00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:47,080
 So advance, print, decide whether you're done,

221
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:50,520
 advance, print, decide whether you're done, advance, print.

222
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:52,720
 Decide whether you're done, advance, print.

223
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,400
 Decide whether you're done, advance, print.

224
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,040
 Decide whether you're done, advance, print.

225
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:58,040
 Decide whether you're done, I am now done,

226
00:09:58,040 --> 00:10:00,840
 because I, whoop, you know,

